# Two ignored dir names, anywhere in the tree (docs/guides/GUIDE.md § Layout):
#   tmp/  reproducible internals + scratch (raw replies, server logs, GPU samples, markers); deleting costs a rerun
#   var/  machine state running services need (llama.cpp builds, Vulkan SDK, venvs, model caches, pidfiles, logs)
tmp/
var/
node_modules
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.idea/
.venv/

# Private companion repo ../amd-private, linked in by its link.sh (notes, archive payload). The launcher home
# (clients/claude) lives in THIS repo since 2026-11-09 (D1); amd-private/clients/claude links back — the dp_
# link set is managed by stack/serve/install.sh.
/notes
/archive
/.claude/skills/brainstorming
/.claude/skills/consider
/.claude/skills/research
/.claude/skills/llama-swap-add-model
/.claude/commands/
/.claude/worktrees/
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
